  aciklama:
  - "Ya\u015Fam, detaylar ve g\xF6ze g\xF6z\xFCkmeyen k\xFC\xE7\xFCk tekrarlar b\xFCt\xFCn\xFCd\xFCr.
    Bize bir s\xFCre sonra s\u0131radan gelen ve her g\xFCn \u015Fahit oldu\u011Fumuz
    g\xFCn do\u011Fumu olmasa, daima karanl\u0131klar i\xE7inde kal\u0131rd\u0131k.||Her
    g\xFCn be\u015F dakika f\u0131r\xE7alamasan, di\u015Flerin \xE7\xFCr\xFCrd\xFC.
    Yerinden hi\xE7 kalkmasan, kas atrofisi ya\u015Far hareket kabiliyetini zay\u0131flat\u0131rd\u0131n.
    Az da olsa, her g\xFCn d\xFCzenli olarak ne yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131na dikkat et."
